# App realtime NATS lane (`c35.user.{owner_iid}.app.*`)

Mirrored for Antigravity: [`.agents/rules/user-app-nats.md`](../../.agents/rules/user-app-nats.md)

Read [`_/specs/sync.md`](../../_/specs/sync.md) — **App realtime lane** section.

## Hard rule

Any **Flutter app** unsolicited push (balance, quota, chat stream, inbox, profile, settings, task run UI) must publish on:

```text
c35.user.{owner_iid}.app.<tail>
```

Use helpers in `servers/crates/system/nats/src/user_app.rs` (`c35_nats::user_app_subject_*`, `user_app_subscribe_subject`). **Never** add new `c35.user.{iid}.balance` / `.chat.{id}` without `.app.` segment.

## Do not use app lane for

| Use | Subject |
|-----|---------|
| Domain events / triggers | `c35.user.{iid}.ev.{slug}` — [`event.md`](../../_/specs/event.md) |
| LLM/tool trace | DB `ai.log` only |
| JetStream work | `c35.prompt.run`, `c35.act.device.*`, … |
| Server-internal cache | `c35.fetch.*`, `c35.inst.*` |
| Channel pair QR | `c35.ev.channel.{owner_iid}.>` (separate WS fanout today) |

## WS fanout

`wire_ws` subscribes **`c35.user.{owner_iid}.app.>`** only (`user_app_nats_fanout`). Decode with `c35_nats::user_app_fanout_decode`.

## New tails

Add a `user_app_subject_*` helper, extend `user_app_fanout_decode`, document the row in `sync.md`, and use `WsRes` unless the payload is already a stable typed proto (billing balance/quota/commission).
